# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# This project is edited on Windows but targets Linux (context/deployment.md
# section 2), so the same checkout may be built from both. Mixed line endings
# would churn diffs, and golden-file tests compare output byte-for-byte.
# Pinning LF everywhere removes the whole category of problem.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Golden test fixtures: preserve bytes exactly, no conversion of any kind.
*.expected -text
*.cmd      -text

# Binaries
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.a   binary
*.o   binary
*.exe binary
